      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im dealing with a really bad sinus infection and can't breathe lol. i'm currently on haloperidol for my schizophrenia stuff, but i was wondering if it's okay to take some sudafed (pseudoephedrine) to help clear up my nose? just want to feel a bit more normal today.",
